WEBVTT

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:07.000
Tap record and speak.

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:13.867
TypeWhisper turns it into text, right on your phone.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:19.467
In other apps, the dictation bubble sits next to the text field.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.400
You keep your own keyboard.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.933
Or switch to the TypeWhisper keyboard and dictate with one tap.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.433
Pick a profile and speak.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.333
A quick note becomes a finished email with a subject.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.500
TypeWhisper for Android.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.767
Now on Google Play.
